{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimalist **FAQ section for Soluna**, inspired closely by the attached desktop and mobile reference screenshots.
    
    IMPORTANT: This must be a **single Shopify section** with a clean, responsive three-part layout. Do not create separate sections.
    
    ### DESKTOP LAYOUT
    
    Create a three-column layout:
    
    **LEFT COLUMN: Intro Content**
    
    Include editable fields for:
    
    * Small subheading
    * Main heading
    * Supporting paragraph
    * Button text
    * Button link
    
    The content should be vertically balanced within the section and aligned towards the left.
    
    The button should have an elegant, premium appearance with adjustable border radius, padding and colours.
    
    ---
    
    **CENTRE COLUMN: Image**
    
    Add an editable Shopify image picker.
    
    The image should sit prominently between the introduction and FAQ area.
    
    Allow the merchant to:
    
    * Upload/change the image
    * Adjust image width
    * Adjust image height
    * Choose image fit: Cover or Contain
    * Adjust border radius
    
    The image should maintain its proportions and look clean and intentional rather than appearing like a standard product card.
    
    ---
    
    **RIGHT COLUMN: FAQ ACCORDION**
    
    Create up to **4 editable FAQ items**.
    
    Each FAQ item should contain:
    
    * Question
    * Answer
    
    The FAQ questions should appear as clean horizontal rows.
    
    Each question must have a **plus (+) icon** when collapsed.
    
    When opened, the icon should smoothly rotate or change into a minus (−) icon.
    
    The answer should smoothly expand and collapse underneath the question.
    
    Use a fast, subtle animation with no harsh movement.
    
    ### IMPORTANT FAQ STYLING
    
    When an FAQ is **collapsed**, it must have a **transparent background** so that the section background remains visible.
    
    When an FAQ is **expanded**, allow the merchant to choose a separate background colour for the expanded FAQ.
    
    Add Theme Editor settings for:
    
    * FAQ collapsed background
    * FAQ expanded background
    * FAQ border colour
    * FAQ text colour
    * FAQ answer colour
    * FAQ border radius
    * FAQ spacing
    * FAQ padding
    * Plus/minus icon colour
    
    The collapsed FAQ items should have a subtle border so they remain clearly visible without looking like heavy cards.
    
    The expanded FAQ should feel visually connected to the collapsed items rather than appearing as a completely separate component.
    
    ### SECTION CUSTOMISATION
    
    Add Theme Editor controls for:
    
    * Section background colour
    * Section text colour
    * Section width
    * Desktop section height
    * Top padding
    * Bottom padding
    * Column spacing
    * Left column width
    * Centre image width
    * FAQ column width
    * Heading size
    * Subheading size
    * Body text size
    * Button background colour
    * Button text colour
    * Button border radius
    * Button padding
    * Image border radius
    
    All text, colours, spacing and content must be editable through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    ### MOBILE LAYOUT
    
    IMPORTANT: The mobile layout must stack the three areas in this exact order:
    
    **1. Intro text and button**
    
    **2. Image**
    
    **3. FAQ accordion**
    
    Do not place the image beside the text on mobile.
    
    Do not place the FAQ beside the image on mobile.
    
    Everything must stack vertically and fit comfortably within the viewport.
    
    The mobile image should automatically resize to the available screen width while maintaining its aspect ratio.
    
    The FAQ accordion should span almost the full available mobile width with sensible side margins.
    
    FAQ questions must wrap naturally if they are long. Do not allow text or icons to overflow horizontally.
    
    Reduce padding, typography and spacing appropriately for mobile while keeping the premium appearance.
    
    ### RESPONSIVE BEHAVIOUR
    
    On desktop, maintain the three-column composition shown in the reference.
    
    On tablet, intelligently reduce column spacing and typography while preserving the three-part structure where possible.
    
    On mobile, switch completely to the stacked layout:
    
    INTRO → IMAGE → FAQ
    
    The transition between layouts should be smooth and there should be no horizontal scrolling.
    
    ### ANIMATION
    
    Keep all interactions clean and swift.
    
    FAQ opening and closing should use a smooth height/opacity transition.
    
    The plus icon should smoothly rotate when an FAQ is opened.
    
    Avoid excessive animations or distracting effects.
    
    The overall experience should feel refined, fast and premium.
    
    ### DESIGN DIRECTION
    
    The section should feel appropriate for a high-end wellness brand such as Soluna.
    
    Use generous spacing, strong typography, subtle borders and restrained visual styling.
    
    Do not make the FAQ cards look like generic ecommerce boxes.
    
    The final result should feel editorial, sophisticated and calm, while remaining highly functional.
    
    ### TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS
    
    * Use Shopify Liquid, HTML, CSS and vanilla JavaScript only.
    * Do not use external libraries.
    * Make every setting editable through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    * Make the section fully responsive.
    * Ensure the FAQ accordion works independently for each question.
    * Allow multiple FAQs to be open at the same time.
    * Do not reload the page when opening or closing FAQs.
    * Use accessible buttons , Make everything center aligned in mobile mode as default.
    
    Give me option to have different colour  for question when collapsed and expanded, Make the defaul background for the section as black
    Make the default text as white
    Collapsed text as white and expanded text as black
    Make the plus icon white when collapsed and black when expanded.
    
    Make it so only one FAQ card can stay open at a time
    , Give me option to change the font everywhere , Make it so that the section is adaptable to the screen size and has enough padding on both ends for even small sccreen, Can you give me access to change the thickness for FAQ border, For button, Give me access to change the height and width seperately for computer and mobile mode, Make sure that the paragraph and the title is adaptable to the space and enter added in the text.
